      "title": "两个秩一扰动的行列式",
      "stem": "计算 $n$ 阶行列式，其第 $(i,j)$ 个元素为 $2\\delta_{ij}+a_i+b_j$。",
      "question_type": "calculation",
      "difficulty_level": 4,
      "answers": [
        {
          "answer_type": "symbolic",
          "answer_text": "令 $A_0=\\sum_i a_i$、$B_0=\\sum_i b_i$、$C_0=\\sum_i a_ib_i$，则\n$$\\det=2^{n-2}\\big((2+A_0)(2+B_0)-nC_0\\big).$$",
          "is_primary": true
        }
      ],
      "solutions": [
        {
          "title": "矩阵行列式引理降为二阶行列式",
          "solution_type": "teaching",
          "text": "令 $e=(1,\\ldots,1)^T$，原矩阵为 $M=2I+ae^T+eb^T=2I+UV^T$，其中 $U=(a,e)$、$V=(e,b)$。由矩阵行列式引理，$\\det M=2^n\\det(I_2+\\frac12V^TU)$。右侧二阶矩阵为 $\\begin{pmatrix}1+A_0/2&n/2\\\\C_0/2&1+B_0/2\\end{pmatrix}$，展开即得答案。",
          "main_method_code": "matrix_determinant_lemma",
          "is_primary": true,
          "steps": [
            {
              "order": 1,
              "role": "transform",
              "text": "把矩阵写成 $2I$ 加两个秩一矩阵。",
              "knowledge_point_code": "low_rank_matrix_update"
            },
            {
              "order": 2,
              "role": "apply_method",
              "text": "使用矩阵行列式引理把 $n$ 阶行列式降为二阶。",
              "method_code": "matrix_determinant_lemma"
            },
            {
              "order": 3,
              "role": "compute",
              "text": "计算四个内积并展开二阶行列式。"
            }
          ]
        }
