          "title": "必要性用秩，充分性逐列选原像",
          "solution_type": "teaching",
          "text": "若 $AX=I_m$，则 $m=\\operatorname{rank}(AX)\\le\\operatorname{rank}A\\le m$，故 $\\operatorname{rank}A=m$。反之，满行秩意味着线性映射 $x\\mapsto Ax$ 从 $\\mathbb R^n$ 到 $\\mathbb R^m$ 满射。对每个标准基向量 $e_j$ 选取 $x_j$ 使 $Ax_j=e_j$，令 $X=(x_1,\\ldots,x_m)$，则 $AX=I_m$。",
          "main_method_code": "choose_preimages_as_columns",
          "is_primary": true,
          "steps": [
            {
              "order": 1,
              "role": "apply_method",
              "text": "由乘积秩不超过因子秩证明必要性。"
