      "title": "全部三阶平方零实矩阵",
      "stem": "求所有满足 $A^2=0$ 的三阶实方阵 $A$。",
      "question_type": "proof",
      "difficulty_level": 3,
      "answers": [
        {
          "answer_type": "symbolic",
          "answer_text": "全部解为\n$$A=uv^T,\\qquad u,v\\in\\mathbb R^3,\\quad v^Tu=0,$$\n其中允许 $u=0$ 或 $v=0$，从而包含零矩阵。",
          "is_primary": true
        }
      ],
      "solutions": [
        {
          "title": "先限秩再作秩一分解",
          "solution_type": "teaching",
          "text": "由 $A^2=0$ 得 $\\operatorname{Im}A\\subseteq\\ker A$，故 $r=\\operatorname{rank}A\\le3-r$，所以 $r\\le1$。非零解均为秩一矩阵，可写成 $A=uv^T$。此时 $A^2=u(v^Tu)v^T=(v^Tu)A$，故平方为零当且仅当 $v^Tu=0$。反向代入也立即成立。",
          "main_method_code": "rank_one_nilpotent_factorization",
          "is_primary": true,
          "steps": [
            {
              "order": 1,
              "role": "conclude",
              "text": "由像包含于核并用秩—零度定理得到秩至多为 $1$。",
              "knowledge_point_code": "square_zero_matrix"
            },
            {
              "order": 2,
              "role": "transform",
              "text": "把非零秩一矩阵写为 $uv^T$。",
              "method_code": "rank_one_nilpotent_factorization"
            },
            {
              "order": 3,
              "role": "compute",
              "text": "计算 $A^2=(v^Tu)A$，得到正交约束。"
            },
            {
              "order": 4,
              "role": "check",
              "text": "验证所有满足该约束的 $uv^T$ 均为解。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
