          "answer_type": "symbolic",
          "answer_text": "令 $d_0=1$，则 $f$ 合同于\n$$d_1y_1^2+\\frac{d_2}{d_1}y_2^2+\\cdots+\\frac{d_n}{d_{n-1}}y_n^2.$$",
